{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22002","headline":"秦中吟十首 五弦 · 白居易","name":"秦中吟十首 五弦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清歌且罢唱，红袂亦停舞。\n赵叟抱五弦，宛转当胸抚。\n大声麄若散，飒飒风和雨。\n小声细欲绝，切切鬼神语。\n又如鹊报喜，转作猨啼苦。\n十指无定音，颠倒宫徵羽。\n坐客闻此声，形神若无主。\n行客闻此声，驻足不能举。\n嗟嗟俗人耳，好今不好古。\n所以绿窗琴，日日生尘土。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}